<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on June 17.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on June 17.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				 June 17		June 16</p>
<p>Fed acct			 7.347		  9.935</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  28.355		 32.922</p>
<p>Cash balance		  35.702		 42.857</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,243.455	     5,269.404</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $5 million were issued and $181 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
